                    <div class="text-center staff-profile-name"><h5>William Morse</h5></div>
                    <div class="text-center staff-profile-position"><p><em>Sierra Club San Diego Chapter Executive Committee</em></p></div></div>
                
                    <div class="modal fade" id="profileModal_20" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="profileModalLabel" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-fullscreen-sm-down"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="profileModalLabel">William Morse</h1>
                        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button></div>
                      <div class="modal-body"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="row"><div class="col-12 col-lg-4"><img src="/files/Uploads/IMG_0232.jpeg" alt="William Morse" class="img-fluid" /></div>
                                <div class="col-12 col-lg-8"><p><strong>Position:</strong> Sierra Club San Diego Chapter Executive Committee</p><div><span id="docs-internal-guid-42efd0bb-7fff-ee48-d6fa-34aa721dd015"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.50545; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; padding: 0pt 0pt 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">I’ve been fortunate to spend most of my life in San Diego, enjoying the ocean and the natural beauty that surrounds us. My goal is to be a champion for the environment so that everyone can continue to benefit from our city’s breathtaking scenery. I have been politically active for as long as I can remember, and my commitment to protecting the environment runs just as deep.</span></p><p dir="ltr" style="line-height: 1.50545; margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 8pt;"><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(34, 34, 34); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;">If elected, I will fight for a cleaner climate for all and look forward to building partnerships that strengthen our shared mission. I am excited to help usher the Sierra Club into a new era while honoring the values that have made it a leader in environmental advocacy.</span></p></span></div></div></div></div></div>
                      <div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button></div></div></div></div>
                </div><div class="col-12 col-lg-3 staff-profile"><div data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#profileModal_21"><div class="text-center staff-profile-image ratio ratio-1x1"><img src="/files/Uploads/Patrick_m.JP
1000
G" alt="Patrick Macfarland " class="img-fluid rounded-circle" /></div>
                    <div class="text-center staff-profile-name"><h5>Patrick Macfarland </h5></div>
                    <div class="text-center staff-profile-position"><p><em>San Diego Sierra Club Executive Committee </em></p></div></div>
                
                    <div class="modal fade" id="profileModal_21" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="profileModalLabel" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-fullscreen-sm-down"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="profileModalLabel">Patrick Macfarland </h1>
                        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button></div>
                      <div class="modal-body"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="row"><div class="col-12 col-lg-4"><img src="/files/Uploads/Patrick_m.JPG" alt="Patrick Macfarland " class="img-fluid" /></div>
                                <div class="col-12 col-lg-8"><p><strong>Position:</strong> San Diego Sierra Club Executive Committee </p><div>I am pleased to announce my candidacy for the Executive Committee of the San Diego chapter of the Sierra Club. I am running because I believe the Sierra Club can play an even stronger role in shaping the political future of our region, and because I want to help make that happen.&nbsp;<div><br></div><div>I currently serve on the San Diego Chapter's Political Committee, where I participate in evaluating candidates and developing strategies for advancing environmental priorities through local government. That experience has reinforced my belief that environmental advocacy is most effective when we build broad coalitions, communicate clearly, and engage voters and elected officials before decisions are made.&nbsp;</div></div></div></div></div></div>
                      <div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button></div></div></div></div>
                </div><div class="col-12 col-lg-3 staff-profile"><div data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#profileModal_22"><div class="text-center staff-profile-image ratio ratio-1x1"><img src="/files/Uploads/Screenshot 2026-11-09 at 2.02.40&#x202F;PM.png" alt="Ann Feeny" class="img-fluid rounded-circle" /></div>
                    <div class="text-center staff-profile-name"><h5>Ann Feeny</h5></div>
                    <div class="text-center staff-profile-position"><p><em>Sierra Club North County Coastal Group Executive Committee</em></p></div></div>
                
                    <div class="modal fade" id="profileModal_22" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="profileModalLabel" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-fullscreen-sm-down"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="profileModalLabel">Ann Feeny</h1>
                        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button></div>
                      <div class="modal-body"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="row"><div class="col-12 col-lg-4"><img src="/files/Uploads/Screenshot 2026-11-09 at 2.02.40&#x202F;PM.png" alt="Ann Feeny" class="img-fluid" /></div>
                                <div class="col-12 col-lg-8"><p><strong>Position:</strong> Sierra Club North County Coastal Group Executive Committee</p><div><span id="docs-internal-guid-66ca2694-7fff-1369-1ed1-ee697e81adb6"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;">I have been a Sierra Club member for as long as I can remember, and about 10 years ago&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">became an active member of the North County Coastal Political Endorsement Committee. I&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">have also been a volunteer for SanDiego350 for 8 years, serving on the Legislative team and&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">CAP team. In 2020, we developed a Build
1000
ing Electrification team whose first action was to&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">establish a coalition of environmental and business groups called the San Diego Building&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">Electrification Coalition, and I am co-chair of that coalition. I have also served on Del Mar’s&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">citizen advisory committee, the Sustainability Advisory Committee, for 3 terms, and was chair&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">of it for 3 years. In the Committee, we have got the City Council to pass several plastic&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">ordinances, and are now at the start of our CAP update. I would be happy to contribute more&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">to the North County Coastal Sierra Club by being on its Executive Committee.</span></p><div><br></div></span></div></div></div></div></div>
                      <div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button></div></div></div></div>
