                    <div class="t
1000
ext-center staff-profile-name"><h5>Susan Sherod </h5></div>
                    <div class="text-center staff-profile-position"><p><em>Sierra Club North County Coastal Group Executive Committee</em></p></div></div>
                
                    <div class="modal fade" id="profileModal_24" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="profileModalLabel" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-fullscreen-sm-down"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="profileModalLabel">Susan Sherod </h1>
                        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button></div>
                      <div class="modal-body"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="row"><div class="col-12 col-lg-4"><img src="/files/Uploads/SCpic2.jpeg" alt="Susan Sherod " class="img-fluid" /></div>
                                <div class="col-12 col-lg-8"><p><strong>Position:</strong> Sierra Club North County Coastal Group Executive Committee</p><div><span id="docs-internal-guid-ef0d2762-7fff-8bef-ba16-a43be3be0063"><p dir="ltr" style="line-height:1.38;margin-top:0pt;margin-bottom:0pt;"><span style="background-color: transparent; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; font-size: 10.5pt; white-space: pre-wrap;">My goals to protect and preserve clean air, land and water are my motivation. I believe we can do more outreach to bolster membership and increase participation in our North County Coastal Group. We can be inclusive of families with children and our large elderly population; adding outings that are shorter, with educational activities to spark people to become environmental stewards who are more aware that each of their choices affects how we protect and preserve the air, land and water, or do not. My tech skill sets, research abilities and strong environmental local to global knowledge will be helpful as an Executive Committee member. Degrees I hold are a B.S in Architectural Studies, an M.A., Industrial and Tech Studies, and a M. of Architecture.</span></p><div><span style="font-size: 10.5pt; font-family: Roboto, sans-serif; color: rgb(0, 0, 0); background-color: transparent; font-variant: normal; vertical-align: baseline; white-space: pre-wrap;"><br></span></div></span></div></div></div></div></div>
                      <div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button></div></div></div></div>
                </div><div class="col-12 col-lg-3 staff-profile"><div data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#profileModal_25"><div class="text-center staff-profile-image ratio ratio-1x1"><img src="/files/Uploads/RK photo.jpeg" alt="Rick Kohl" class="img-fluid rounded-circle" /></div>
                    <div class="text-center staff-profile-name"><h5>Rick Kohl</h5></div>
                    <div class="text-center staff-profile-position"><p><em>Sierra Club North County Coastal Group Executive Committee</em></p></div></div>
                
                    <div class="modal fade" id="profileModal_25" tabindex="-1" aria-labelledby="profileModalLabel" aria-hidden="true"><div class="modal-dialog modal-lg modal-fullscreen-sm-down"><div class="modal-content"><div class="modal-header"><h1 class="modal-title fs-5" id="profileModalLabel">Rick Kohl</h1>
                        <button type="button" class="btn-close" data-bs-dismiss="modal" aria-label="Close"></button></div>
                      <div class="modal-body"><div class="container-fluid"><div class="row"><div class="col-12 col-lg-4"><img src="/files/Uploads/RK photo.jpeg" alt="Rick Kohl" class="img-fluid" /></div>
                                <div class="col-12 col-lg-8"><p><strong>Position:</strong> Sierra Club North County Coastal Group Executive Committee</p><div><div>As an environmentalist, I studied engineering and environmental science with an emphasis on&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">alternative energies.</span></div><div><br></div><div>Upon graduation I worked for severa
1000
l solar installation companies and designed the largest&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">active solar heating project for agricultural use in the state. I also designed passive solar&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">Systems. As an Energy Engineer for Pacific Gas and Electric Company (PG&amp;amp;E), I performed hundreds of technical energy efficiency studies for many Silicon Valley Companies including IBM, Tandem Computer and Quantum Corporation.</span></div><div><br></div><div>When I left PG&amp;E, I was hired as a consultant to the City of San Jose where I helped develop&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">the I.D.E.A.S. Program, which provided energy improvement in new construction beyond the&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">state’s Title 24 compliance. I also recommended energy improvements for the new arena&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">being built, home of the San Jose Sharks.</span></div><div><br></div><div>I later formed a consulting firm that specializes in cost reduction of energy for mid-size and&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">large companies, most with national footprints.</span></div><div><br></div><div>In 1997, I formed Go-Green, the first retail 100% renewable energy provider in the state. The&nbsp;<span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">company had endorsements from numerous environmental groups and served thousands of&nbsp;</span><span style="background-color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0);">customers throughout the state.</span></div><div><br></div><div>BSME and MBA. LEED Certified.</div><div><br></div></div></div></div></div></div>
                      <div class="modal-footer"><button type="button" class="btn btn-secondary" data-bs-dismiss="modal">Close</button></div></div></div></div>
                </div><div class="col-12 col-lg-3 staff-profile"><div data-bs-toggle="modal" data-bs-target="#profileModal_26"><div class="text-center staff-profile-image ratio ratio-1x1"><img src="/files/Uploads/JAE_lifetouch - Copy.JPG" alt="John Eldon" class="img-fluid rounded-circle" /></div>
